        <div class="user-profile__about">
       <h3 class="user-profile__title">About me</h3>
       <div class="user-profile__about-content">Hi everyone! My name is Henry Xu. I am currently a senior&nbsp;at Sunset High School and am extremely passionate about AI in education. Together with two of my friends, I founded AIRethought, an organization dedicated&nbsp;to promoting AI literacy to teachers. I've been fortunate enough to have helped directly draft district-wide AI policy with the head of curriculum and CIO, develop AI software used by multiple&nbsp;schools, and worked directly with thousands of teachers.<br>I am also extremely passionate about computer science&nbsp;and agentic AI, developing software tools that promote transparent AI usage between teachers and students. Outside of AI, I love attending&nbsp;hackathons, watching basketball, and am an active member of the Chinese-American community, helping start Beaverton School District's first ever Mandarin&nbsp;Dual Language program.<br><br>I'd love to chat about AI, technology, entrepreneurship, basketball (or anything really!) I'd love to connect! Linkedin: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/henry-xu-profile565/" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);" target="_blank">https://www.linkedin.com/in/henry-xu-profile565/</a>  <br>Github: <a href="https://github.com/henhen1235" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);" target="_blank">https://github.com/henhen1235</a><br>Organization Website: <a href="https://airethought.org/" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);" target="_blank">https://airethought.org/</a></div>
     </div>
   
   <div style="margin-bottom: 20px">
       </div>

